# Romanian weekday, bare and with the enclitic definite article.  The
# articulated form (miercurea) is the ordinary written shape in
# "miercurea trecută/viitoare" (= last/next Wednesday).  Definite article of the
# days of the week per dexonline / DOOM.
# https://dexonline.ro/definitie/miercuri
miercuri
miercurea
